{"ep": "13", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:02.84", "end": "0:00:05.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的  我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:07.22", "end": "0:00:12.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:12.81", "end": "0:00:16.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:16.82", "end": "0:00:21.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:23.59", "end": "0:00:24.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搞什么啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:25.49", "end": "0:00:26.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:27.20", "end": "0:00:28.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:29.28", "end": "0:00:30.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:30.74", "end": "0:00:33.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:36.16", "end": "0:00:38.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:39.67", "end": "0:00:40.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:40.70", "end": "0:00:42.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:42.54", "end": "0:00:45.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:45.38", "end": "0:00:48.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后一定要骑自行车来  Over～"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 14, "start": "0:00:48.72", "end": "0:00:50.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要是也"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 15, "start": "0:00:51.67", "end": "0:00:55.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥  我好像又知道春日打算要说啥"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 16, "start": "0:00:56.40", "end": "0:00:57.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不对"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 17, "start": "0:00:57.71", "end": "0:01:01.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说  是感觉之前好像出现过完全相同的事情"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:02.28", "end": "0:01:04.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是所谓的「既视感」么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:07.00", "end": "0:01:09.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这下没话说了  阳春全垒打"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 20, "start": "0:01:11.33", "end": "0:01:13.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天就这样缴枪了啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:49.31", "end": "0:02:50.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 22, "start": "0:02:50.91", "end": "0:02:52.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 23, "start": "0:02:52.76", "end": "0:02:53.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 24, "start": "0:02:54.32", "end": "0:02:55.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等真抱歉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 25, "start": "0:02:56.13", "end": "0:02:57.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也才刚到"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 26, "start": "0:02:58.02", "end": "0:03:00.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:00.83", "end": "0:03:01.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:01.57", "end": "0:03:03.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:03.74", "end": "0:03:05.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  从这准备的架势来看也是吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:06.64", "end": "0:03:09.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天要有夏天的样子  不能不做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:10.10", "end": "0:03:13.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:13.25", "end": "0:03:14.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:15.23", "end": "0:03:18.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:18.81", "end": "0:03:20.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便我们是用自行车去泳池"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:21.57", "end": "0:03:23.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们也骑来了么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:23.44", "end": "0:03:26.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  自行车只有你和我的两辆"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:26.97", "end": "0:03:27.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:29.46", "end": "0:03:32.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好了  阿虚  可不能输给古泉哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:32.36", "end": "0:03:34.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  立即出发！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:34.32", "end": "0:03:34.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不会吧…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:37.90", "end": "0:03:40.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们两个赶紧停好车！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 42, "start": "0:03:40.53", "end": "0:03:43.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  接下来是要玩啊  你怎么就筋疲力尽了？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 43, "start": "0:03:43.59", "end": "0:03:45.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是谁的错啊  谁的啊！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 44, "start": "0:03:50.03", "end": "0:03:54.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:00.25", "end": "0:04:03.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶紧过来  水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:03.66", "end": "0:04:06.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙就看不见那些禁止跳水的文字说明么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:07.04", "end": "0:04:08.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "挺欢乐的嘛"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:09.41", "end": "0:04:12.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是很欢乐的情景  而且让人感到和平"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:14.05", "end": "0:04:18.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得  凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:18.90", "end": "0:04:23.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然打个电话过来  单方面地说有事就挂的邀请方式"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:23.51", "end": "0:04:25.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实在不能说得上是常识性的吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:25.59", "end": "0:04:29.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就那点事  要我说根本不算什么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:29.76", "end": "0:04:34.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学  是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:36.98", "end": "0:04:38.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:38.89", "end": "0:04:39.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:39.81", "end": "0:04:40.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 57, "start": "0:04:41.64", "end": "0:04:44.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  大概是错觉吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 58, "start": "0:04:45.12", "end": "0:04:49.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "初春以来发生了种种事情的缘故  只是变得有点神经质了吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:00.56", "end": "0:05:01.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好热"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:02.88", "end": "0:05:03.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好热…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:04.04", "end": "0:05:05.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好热～"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:07.76", "end": "0:05:08.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:09.03", "end": "0:05:13.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:13.91", "end": "0:05:16.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为啥春日要选这种地方"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:15.31", "end": "0:05:16.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接着！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:24.45", "end": "0:05:26.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了  这种感觉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:27.72", "end": "0:05:29.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得这种景象以前也见到过"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:30.52", "end": "0:05:33.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥觉得长门好像有些无聊…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:35.43", "end": "0:05:36.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:38.85", "end": "0:05:42.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  然后春日说了这种话"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:42.48", "end": "0:05:44.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:44.71", "end": "0:05:47.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:48.74", "end": "0:05:50.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  要玩了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 74, "start": "0:05:50.51", "end": "0:05:52.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中足球吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 75, "start": "0:05:52.56", "end": "0:05:53.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好好"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 76, "start": "0:05:54.03", "end": "0:05:55.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  这种事也常有"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 77, "start": "0:05:55.63", "end": "0:05:56.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 78, "start": "0:05:56.68", "end": "0:05:58.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来了哦  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 79, "start": "0:05:58.38", "end": "0:05:59.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好～"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:03.89", "end": "0:06:07.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我试着考虑了下今后的活动计划  如何呢？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:08.09", "end": "0:06:10.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要在不到两周内搞完这个么…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:10.51", "end": "0:06:12.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:12.85", "end": "0:06:15.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:16.16", "end": "0:06:18.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK  捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:19.29", "end": "0:06:20.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:26.36", "end": "0:06:27.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:27.23", "end": "0:06:28.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:28.69", "end": "0:06:30.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:31.18", "end": "0:06:32.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:33.21", "end": "0:06:34.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:35.34", "end": "0:06:36.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别忘了捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:37.24", "end": "0:06:39.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是实玖瑠的强烈要求哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 93, "start": "0:06:39.72", "end": "0:06:40.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "了解"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 94, "start": "0:06:41.64", "end": "0:06:43.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "付钱的又是我啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 95, "start": "0:06:44.67", "end": "0:06:46.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  今天就此解散"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 96, "start": "0:06:46.67", "end": "0:06:47.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我也回去了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 97, "start": "0:06:47.69", "end": "0:06:48.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:03.98", "end": "0:07:04.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:10.15", "end": "0:07:13.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  不…我什么事也没有"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:13.61", "end": "0:07:16.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近如何  精神好么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:16.94", "end": "0:07:17.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:18.09", "end": "0:07:19.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那太好了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:23.37", "end": "0:07:23.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:29.64", "end": "0:07:32.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  为什么我会去搭腔"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:34.36", "end": "0:07:39.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天早晨  将我的懒觉夺走的又是春日打来的电话"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:39.49", "end": "0:07:41.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "似乎是说找到盂兰盆会的会场了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:41.44", "end": "0:07:43.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今晚  地点似乎是市民运动场"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:49.07", "end": "0:07:50.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家一起去买浴衣！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:51.48", "end": "0:07:53.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日进了女装的大卖场之后"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:54.11", "end": "0:07:56.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "擅自为朝比奈学姐和长门挑选了浴衣"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 111, "start": "0:07:56.56", "end": "0:07:58.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后毫不客气地冲进了试衣间"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 112, "start": "0:07:58.66", "end": "0:08:00.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后我们等了大约一小时"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:00.90", "end": "0:08:02.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三个人终于都出来了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:04.81", "end": "0:08:06.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  都非常合适哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:06.69", "end": "0:08:08.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然了  是我给挑选的嘛"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:09.34", "end": "0:08:10.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:11.06", "end": "0:08:13.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好可爱  真不愧是我挑的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:14.21", "end": "0:08:15.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是…是"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:15.51", "end": "0:08:17.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "脸颊红润三倍可爱！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:23.88", "end": "0:08:27.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "盂兰盆会啊  真亏得能聚集起这么多人啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:28.14", "end": "0:08:28.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:30.54", "end": "0:08:34.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明应该是很久没来了  却觉得最近就来过"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:35.16", "end": "0:08:36.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个楼塔"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:36.60", "end": "0:08:37.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个摊子"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:37.76", "end": "0:08:38.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:38.93", "end": "0:08:41.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边有你想要玩的捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:41.61", "end": "0:08:43.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捞个痛快吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:43.28", "end": "0:08:43.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好～"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 129, "start": "0:08:46.24", "end": "0:08:49.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吧  来一决高下如何"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 130, "start": "0:08:49.94", "end": "0:08:50.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 131, "start": "0:08:51.85", "end": "0:08:52.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起这个来  长门"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 132, "start": "0:08:53.33", "end": "0:08:54.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要吃点什么吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:14.49", "end": "0:09:15.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:15.54", "end": "0:09:17.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:18.56", "end": "0:09:19.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:19.39", "end": "0:09:19.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:22.27", "end": "0:09:22.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:22.90", "end": "0:09:24.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:27.27", "end": "0:09:29.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:30.20", "end": "0:09:32.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种东西由我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:34.94", "end": "0:09:37.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀  大丰收啊大丰收"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:37.27", "end": "0:09:40.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我不需要那么多  就只要了一条"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:40.54", "end": "0:09:42.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有给实玖瑠的那份"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:45.92", "end": "0:09:47.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只吃一个的话没关系哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:49.27", "end": "0:09:50.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 146, "start": "0:09:57.96", "end": "0:10:00.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  有希你那面具哪里弄来的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:00.95", "end": "0:10:01.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:02.36", "end": "0:10:04.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  是么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:06.26", "end": "0:10:08.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  接下来玩烟花吧  烟花"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:08.49", "end": "0:10:10.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:10.95", "end": "0:10:14.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道「吃饭只吃八分饱」这俗语吗  你这家伙"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:15.83", "end": "0:10:18.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:18.52", "end": "0:10:21.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:21.47", "end": "0:10:23.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:26.07", "end": "0:10:27.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天是捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:27.99", "end": "0:10:31.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:31.80", "end": "0:10:35.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么啊  那样的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:35.76", "end": "0:10:36.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三天？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:37.25", "end": "0:10:40.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:40.44", "end": "0:10:42.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再毫无后顾之忧地玩到爽"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:42.80", "end": "0:10:45.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:46.05", "end": "0:10:48.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:51.02", "end": "0:10:55.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上天对于人的参数调整还真是随便啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:56.87", "end": "0:10:59.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  明天去捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:59.85", "end": "0:11:04.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人  就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:04.46", "end": "0:11:04.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "才不要呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:05.16", "end": "0:11:08.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很有趣呢  只要是虫子的话什么都可以么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:08.60", "end": "0:11:10.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…只能抓蝉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:11.00", "end": "0:11:14.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:16.63", "end": "0:11:20.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:20.51", "end": "0:11:22.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各人都以自己的方式进行了奋斗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:23.10", "end": "0:11:26.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该说不出所料还是说啥呢  获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:27.14", "end": "0:11:29.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说到底  还是要有放生的精神"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:30.59", "end": "0:11:33.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:34.17", "end": "0:11:36.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "蝉来了到底能为我做些啥啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:37.33", "end": "0:11:39.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  快回山里去吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:46.30", "end": "0:11:49.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总觉得  有点打开了盒子的潘多拉的感觉呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:53.19", "end": "0:11:55.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢…欢迎光临"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:55.83", "end": "0:11:59.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  我们在还没搞清状况的状态下就被召集了起来"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:59.79", "end": "0:12:02.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在一无所知的情况下被套上了青蛙的罩衣"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:02.82", "end": "0:12:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开始在超市的门口发气球的兼职"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:09.44", "end": "0:12:10.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位辛苦了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:11.14", "end": "0:12:12.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这待遇差算啥啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:13.09", "end": "0:12:13.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "辛苦了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:14.18", "end": "0:12:16.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:16.46", "end": "0:12:17.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:18.25", "end": "0:12:19.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:19.41", "end": "0:12:20.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:20.19", "end": "0:12:20.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:20.91", "end": "0:12:23.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要这个了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:23.39", "end": "0:12:25.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:26.26", "end": "0:12:29.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西累死累活地干活么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:30.27", "end": "0:12:32.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把这放在社团室做纪念吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:32.64", "end": "0:12:35.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:35.97", "end": "0:12:37.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:45.39", "end": "0:12:48.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那天晚上  夺去了我的安眠的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:48.40", "end": "0:12:50.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是一个电话"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:51.93", "end": "0:12:52.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:58.09", "end": "0:12:59.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:01.10", "end": "0:13:01.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:03.26", "end": "0:13:05.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是我"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:05.65", "end": "0:13:10.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是有不好的事情…这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:12.41", "end": "0:13:13.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:13.14", "end": "0:13:14.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:16.27", "end": "0:13:18.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么会跟朝比奈学姐在一起"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:19.30", "end": "0:13:23.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况啊  你能现在就过来么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:24.02", "end": "0:13:25.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "马上就去  哪里？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:30.32", "end": "0:13:31.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "究竟怎么了？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:31.94", "end": "0:13:32.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 210, "start": "0:13:36.23", "end": "0:13:38.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  我…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:41.89", "end": "0:13:45.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不了未来了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:54.18", "end": "0:13:55.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  事情是这样的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:56.75", "end": "0:13:59.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在重复同样的时间"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 214, "start": "0:14:00.16", "end": "0:14:03.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种非现实的话你还真能满面春光地说出来呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 215, "start": "0:14:03.55", "end": "0:14:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你知道自己在说什么吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:06.90", "end": "0:14:10.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道  没有比现在更清楚的了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:10.42", "end": "0:14:12.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才和朝比奈学姐谈了下"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:13.01", "end": "0:14:14.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是叫上我啊  这么美的谈话"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:15.20", "end": "0:14:19.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后意识到最近这里时间的流动出现了异常"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:20.47", "end": "0:14:23.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这该说是朝比奈学姐的功绩吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:23.43", "end": "0:14:25.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "托她的福我也确信了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:25.47", "end": "0:14:26.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确信什么了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:27.33", "end": "0:14:31.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正无数次重复体验同样的时间"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:31.89", "end": "0:14:33.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个刚才就听你说了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:33.71", "end": "0:14:37.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:38.26", "end": "0:14:40.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是就变成这样漫无止境的夏天了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:40.47", "end": "0:14:45.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这个世界里  九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:45.79", "end": "0:14:48.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐无法回到未来也是因为这个"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:49.17", "end": "0:14:50.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是理所当然的了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:51.02", "end": "0:14:53.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "物理性的没有未来哪里理所当然了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:53.82", "end": "0:14:55.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信那个啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:55.70", "end": "0:14:58.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 233, "start": "0:14:58.79", "end": "0:15:02.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…也由我来说明一下吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:02.96", "end": "0:15:03.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:04.46", "end": "0:15:10.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为禁止说明的事项  我一直在和未来联系和做禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:11.33", "end": "0:15:15.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一个礼拜左右没有禁止说明的事项了啊  有点奇怪啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:16.43", "end": "0:15:19.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我正这么想着  于是禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:20.45", "end": "0:15:24.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我吓了一大跳  慌张之下就做了禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:25.10", "end": "0:15:28.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但就算是做了  也完全是禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:28.66", "end": "0:15:30.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我…该怎么办…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:30.66", "end": "0:15:33.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "该怎么办好  我也不知道啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:33.46", "end": "0:15:37.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说那个禁止说明的事项是放送禁止用语什么的吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:38.05", "end": "0:15:42.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们被困在那个叫什么封闭空间里了吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:44.31", "end": "0:15:45.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:46.74", "end": "0:15:49.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一部分的时间被分割开了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:50.22", "end": "0:15:53.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到八月三十一日二十四时整的那一瞬"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:53.79", "end": "0:15:58.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都被重置  再回到十七日的过程"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:58.73", "end": "0:15:59.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:59.94", "end": "0:16:01.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  全人类的记忆呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 250, "start": "0:16:02.18", "end": "0:16:06.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些也会重置  会从头再来一次"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:06.35", "end": "0:16:08.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是关于时间这个那个了的问题吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:08.84", "end": "0:16:11.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然未来人也混进来了那我觉得也没办法"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:12.11", "end": "0:16:14.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  这件事和朝比奈学姐没关系"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 254, "start": "0:16:15.14", "end": "0:16:16.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那原因是什么"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 255, "start": "0:16:16.78", "end": "0:16:17.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 256, "start": "0:16:20.60", "end": "0:16:22.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然本人没有意识到"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 257, "start": "0:16:22.26", "end": "0:16:26.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 258, "start": "0:16:27.02", "end": "0:16:29.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那算啥啊  难道留着什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 259, "start": "0:16:30.36", "end": "0:16:31.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是这么想的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 260, "start": "0:16:31.93", "end": "0:16:36.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 261, "start": "0:16:36.40", "end": "0:16:40.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还真是个会把一些莫名其妙的事情\n展开到大宇宙规模的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:40.92", "end": "0:16:42.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我该怎么办"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:42.84", "end": "0:16:45.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明白了这个的话  问题就能迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:42.84", "end": "0:16:46.68", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（注：激奏上小野大辅也是这样把脸凑向杉田，\n然后杉田吐槽他脸靠太近XD）"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:45.66", "end": "0:16:46.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都说过了脸靠太近了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 266, "start": "0:16:47.16", "end": "0:16:48.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从刚才开始我就有点在意"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 267, "start": "0:16:49.07", "end": "0:16:50.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好像乐在其中呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 268, "start": "0:16:51.67", "end": "0:16:53.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不也是吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 269, "start": "0:16:54.12", "end": "0:16:58.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为最近频繁发生的既视感之谜终于解开了嘛"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 270, "start": "0:16:58.64", "end": "0:17:04.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在想来  那只能理解为是由于记忆重置而散落下来的残渣吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:05.94", "end": "0:17:08.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说  全世界的人都感觉得到吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:09.16", "end": "0:17:10.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非那样"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:10.84", "end": "0:17:12.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和你算是特例了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:13.50", "end": "0:17:18.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像只有和凉宫同学亲近的人才能感觉到这份异样"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 275, "start": "0:17:19.24", "end": "0:17:20.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那春日怎么样"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 276, "start": "0:17:20.78", "end": "0:17:22.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙多少有一点意识到吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 277, "start": "0:17:22.95", "end": "0:17:24.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点都没有呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:25.30", "end": "0:17:27.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说有了反而糟糕了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:27.89", "end": "0:17:29.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 280, "start": "0:17:30.03", "end": "0:17:35.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 281, "start": "0:17:36.15", "end": "0:17:38.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁啊  那个人"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 282, "start": "0:17:38.56", "end": "0:17:39.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说也该知道吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 283, "start": "0:17:40.52", "end": "0:17:41.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是长门同学"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 284, "start": "0:17:42.00", "end": "0:17:44.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然是超越了时空的情报统合思念体的话"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 285, "start": "0:17:45.17", "end": "0:17:47.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得也许是的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 286, "start": "0:17:48.80", "end": "0:17:49.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是这样的吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 287, "start": "0:17:50.05", "end": "0:17:50.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 288, "start": "0:17:51.36", "end": "0:17:53.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你…全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 289, "start": "0:17:53.79", "end": "0:17:54.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 290, "start": "0:17:54.84", "end": "0:17:57.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  到底重复几次了？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 291, "start": "0:17:58.57", "end": "0:18:02.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15498次"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:03.93", "end": "0:18:06.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15498？"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:07.08", "end": "0:18:09.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15498是啥啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:09.70", "end": "0:18:11.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你在说啥啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:12.23", "end": "0:18:13.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 296, "start": "0:18:14.42", "end": "0:18:15.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 297, "start": "0:18:15.98", "end": "0:18:20.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 298, "start": "0:18:20.48", "end": "0:18:21.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 299, "start": "0:18:22.40", "end": "0:18:31.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15498次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 300, "start": "0:18:31.53", "end": "0:18:36.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 301, "start": "0:18:36.60", "end": "0:18:40.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有9025次  其内容有6个…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 302, "start": "0:18:40.74", "end": "0:18:42.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不  已经够了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 303, "start": "0:18:46.52", "end": "0:18:49.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15498次"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 304, "start": "0:18:50.02", "end": "0:18:51.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 305, "start": "0:18:51.68", "end": "0:18:54.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 306, "start": "0:18:54.50", "end": "0:18:56.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是594年的时间了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 307, "start": "0:18:57.37", "end": "0:18:59.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 308, "start": "0:18:59.58", "end": "0:19:03.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:04.63", "end": "0:19:09.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都以什么样的心情度过的啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 310, "start": "0:19:16.29", "end": "0:19:18.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我又听了荒唐的话了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 311, "start": "0:19:19.51", "end": "0:19:21.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天是观测天体"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 312, "start": "0:19:22.14", "end": "0:19:24.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地点是长门公寓的楼顶"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 313, "start": "0:19:24.81", "end": "0:19:27.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天体望远镜由古泉准备"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 314, "start": "0:19:28.95", "end": "0:19:29.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不是没有啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 315, "start": "0:19:29.96", "end": "0:19:30.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 316, "start": "0:19:30.62", "end": "0:19:31.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "火星人"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 317, "start": "0:19:31.35", "end": "0:19:32.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我倒不希望它存在啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 318, "start": "0:19:33.07", "end": "0:19:34.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地表看起来没人"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 319, "start": "0:19:35.19", "end": "0:19:37.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该是在地下的生活着的害羞人种"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 320, "start": "0:19:38.15", "end": "0:19:39.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是一群很友好的人"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 321, "start": "0:19:39.86", "end": "0:19:41.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那可不一定哦"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 322, "start": "0:19:41.27", "end": "0:19:46.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "人类第一次踏上火星的时候  一定会从暗处跑出来欢迎吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 323, "start": "0:19:47.11", "end": "0:19:48.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「欢迎来到火星」什么的"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 324, "start": "0:19:48.90", "end": "0:19:50.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "感觉会误会成袭击吧"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 325, "start": "0:19:51.22", "end": "0:19:52.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我看够了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 326, "start": "0:19:53.03", "end": "0:19:54.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去找UFO吧  UFO"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 327, "start": "0:20:00.32", "end": "0:20:02.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 328, "start": "0:20:02.52", "end": "0:20:04.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 329, "start": "0:20:04.36", "end": "0:20:06.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个能搞清楚的话问题也就迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 330, "start": "0:20:08.17", "end": "0:20:09.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 331, "start": "0:20:10.81", "end": "0:20:13.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 332, "start": "0:20:13.41", "end": "0:20:16.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 333, "start": "0:20:17.16", "end": "0:20:18.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 334, "start": "0:20:19.26", "end": "0:20:21.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你没有适合的人了"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 335, "start": "0:20:23.37", "end": "0:20:24.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拒绝权发动！"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 336, "start": "0:20:25.37", "end": "0:20:26.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不干"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 337, "start": "0:20:28.33", "end": "0:20:30.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "13", "idx": 338, "start": "0:20:34.32", "end": "0:20:37.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的了  我做这角色还不够格"}
